# A module directory that declares no plugin.
#
# The real Quickshell installs /usr/lib/qt6/qml/Quickshell with a qmldir saying
#
#     linktarget quickshell-coreplugin
#     optional plugin quickshell-coreplugin
#
# and that directory is found on the default QML import path — the same one
# QtQuick lives on, so it cannot simply be removed. A directory module wins over
# a C++ registration for the same URI, so registering the compatibility types
# was not enough on its own: every `import Quickshell` still resolved to the
# real module and died on the missing plugin.
#
# This directory is added to the engine's import path ahead of the default one,
# so the URI resolves here instead — to a module that asks for no plugin at all
# and whose types come from the C++ registrations in the host binary.
module Quickshell
